---
kind: lore
id: mid.mindGymTrainers
title: The Mind Gym's students and guide (Silvercrest)
---

// Sabine's three students among the warp tiles, and the guide at the door.
// The gym opens only once Helix Tower is freed (gate mindGymDoor).

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="mindGymPsychicOren" who="mindGymPsychicOren" intro="The warp tile you just stepped on? I told it to bring you here." win="I told it to bring you somewhere else, next time." lose="See? The tiles listen to me." prize="880" instance="use-001"/>

<entry id="midMindGymPsychicOrenAfter" on="talk" target="npc.mindGymPsychicOren" category="bark" when="holds('defeated', ['mindGymPsychicOren'])">
  @mindGymPsychicOren{code="0010"}: The trick to the tiles is to stop thinking about where you want to go. Sabine says that's the trick to most things.
</entry>

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="mindGymMediumSelke" who="mindGymMediumSelke" intro="While the door was sealed, I held séances. The spirits said a child would come. They were vague about the time." win="The spirits also said I would win. The spirits need to be more specific." lose="The spirits send their regards." prize="840" instance="use-002"/>

<entry id="midMindGymMediumSelkeAfter" on="talk" target="npc.mindGymMediumSelke" category="bark" when="holds('defeated', ['mindGymMediumSelke'])">
  @mindGymMediumSelke{code="0010"}: If you have the Spectral Lens, look through it in the old theater on the square. Don't tell Sabine I said so. She thinks ghosts are unscientific.
</entry>

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="mindGymPsychicTamsin" who="mindGymPsychicTamsin" intro="I'm the last student before Sabine. I can bend spoons. Let's see what I can do to your plans." win="My spoon's bent and so's my pride." lose="Spoon: bent. Challenger: bent." prize="920" instance="use-003"/>

<entry id="midMindGymPsychicTamsinAfter" on="talk" target="npc.mindGymPsychicTamsin" category="bark" when="holds('defeated', ['mindGymPsychicTamsin'])">
  @mindGymPsychicTamsin{code="0010"}: Sabine's through the last tile. She already knows you're coming. She's known since Tuesday.
</entry>

<entry id="midMindGymGuideSealed" on="talk" target="npc.mindGymGuide" category="bark" priority="10" when="!holds('canPass', ['mindGymDoor'])">
  @mindGymGuide{code="0010"}: Yo, champ in the making! I'd love to give you the tour, but the Director's goons sealed us up from the tower across the square. Nobody in, nobody out. I've been out here eleven days.
</entry>

<entry id="midMindGymGuideOpen" on="talk" target="npc.mindGymGuide" category="bark" priority="10" when="holds('canPass', ['mindGymDoor']) && !holds('hasBadge', ['mind'])">
  @mindGymGuide{code="0010"}: Yo, champ! Doors are open! Sabine's psychic types hit hard, but they hate bugs and ghosts. And don't try to read the warp tiles. You'll get a headache.
</entry>

<entry id="midMindGymGuideDone" on="talk" target="npc.mindGymGuide" category="bark" priority="20" when="holds('hasBadge', ['mind'])">
  @mindGymGuide{code="0010"}: The Mind Badge! I knew you had it in you. Well, Sabine knew. She told me. Last week.
</entry>
